  $('#stockTypeFilter').innerHTML=[['all','Semua'],['own',activeLedger==='raw'?'Bahan produksi':'Hasil produksi'],['shared','Siap jual']].map(([v,l])=>`<button class="${v===stockType?'active':''}" data-type="${v}">${l}</button>`).join('');$$('#stockStatusFilter button').forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.status===stockStatus);b.onclick=()=>{stockStatus=b.dataset.status;renderInventory()}});$$('#stockTypeFilter button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{stockType=b.dataset.type;renderInventory()});
